comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T19:40:57.328Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: strict complete3115-item all-status corpus plus refreshed open/in_progress inventories and request-specific aggregate telemetry pairing search; full live pm-5oj5 and closed paired-sampling lineage pm-wrdctq were read. No canonical owner matched this newly observed four-row cohort. Intake only and unclaimed."
  "2026-10-25T19:41:57.802Z","harness:codex","Refined source attribution: the four unmatched aggregate starts all report pm_version2026.10.24 and source_context automation. No current2026.10.25 mismatch is established by that cohort. Keep the intake open/unclaimed and retain termination or timeout as an unverified explanation rather than asserting ingestion loss."
  "2026-10-26T05:30:06.130Z","harness:codex","Fresh October26 live telemetry evidence extends this existing investigation: complete installation/session/command pairing since2026-10-25T23:39Z over producer2026.10.25/26 found1398 starts,1394 finishes and four settled unmatched starts. All four are producer2026.10.25 with source_context automation: aggregate at00:06:48Z, assurance at01:16:16Z, get at01:29:56Z and aggregate at03:17:42Z. Termination versus ingestion remains unverified; no2026.10.26 mismatch was established by this cohort. Keep the canonical investigation open and unclaimed. Forty command families show average ingestion1.229seconds; required seven-day error/code gate passes at5.22percent with zero missing failure codes. A fresh Sentry pm.command contracts span at05:26:14Z is visible, but streamed span detail is temporarily unavailable from the provider. This is operational evidence, not proof that every historical action has a finish."
  "2026-10-26T19:33:09.078Z","harness:codex","October26 19:31 UTC scoped operational refresh: this checkout installation has339 settled command starts and339 finishes since09:50 UTC with zero mismatched session/command groups; the physical pm.telemetry.events queue has0 total/ready/unacknowledged messages. Earlier16:00/17:00 local-hour batches arrived late (largest6412seconds), so the full-window average466seconds must not be reported as real-time delivery. The most recent12 lifecycle rows arrive in0.154–0.870seconds, and the20:00 local-hour mean is0.559seconds over87rows. Current required Sentry/telemetry gate passes at5.35percent seven-day finish errors, zero missing error codes and zero recent blocking Sentry issues; a real19:21 UTC pm events command span is visible. This installation-scoped proof does not resolve the historical automation mismatch investigation or establish its cause."
  "2026-10-26T22:44:13.806Z","harness:codex","Live continuation observation: the telemetry query window beginning 2026-10-26 21:52 UTC contains 689 command starts and 683 finishes across all installations, with 6 unequal session/command groups. Restricting the same window to the installation that emitted the traced acceptance read returns zero unequal groups. Its pm get completion reached the backend within 0.678 seconds. Keep the cross-installation aggregate discrepancy separate from current-client pairing; this observation neither assigns a cause nor claims the broader investigation complete. The required Sentry/telemetry gate passes with zero critical/high recent Sentry issues and no telemetry failures missing an error code."
  "2026-10-27T00:11:22.542Z","harness:codex","Post-closeout observation, kept separate from the earlier bounded sample: after SDK flush, the expanded quiet window for this installation since 2026-10-26 21:52 UTC contains 143 command starts and 142 finishes, with one unequal session/command group. Its only event is changelog generate starting at 23:58:56.570 UTC. The outer package-generation command later returned exit 143; this is correlation, not proof of the signal sender or a production root cause. The subsequent package-owned generation/check succeeds. The earlier 82/82 window ending 23:35:10 UTC remains accurate. Empty physical queues and broker depth do not establish complete terminal pairing, and no synthetic historical finish was inserted. This existing investigation stays open and unclaimed; interrupted-command terminal evidence still requires diagnosis."
  "2026-10-27T07:51:20.210Z","harness:codex","Review4386092206: corrected actual_result through the CLI using a fresh complete post-flush join, cutoff2026-10-27T07:46:31.752Z,388 starts/387 finishes/one unequal changelog group at23:58:56.570Z. Prior bounded40/40 and82/82 observations and later143/142 and241/240 checkpoints remain immutable historical evidence, rather than the current summary. Queue emptiness does not establish event pairing, and this update does not claim lifecycle repair or a termination cause."
  "2026-10-27T09:41:48.964Z","harness:codex","Fresh final-source7bca9b08fa67733bee9002c462d16f2a70704b87 reconciliation exposes a separate post-source gap: window08:41:00..09:32:36.085UTC has10 starts/9 finishes and one unequal history group starting09:23:31.637UTC, source_context automation. All seven full history readers in the closure audit completed with native exit0 and parsed complete results. The physical client queue and broker are empty. Investigate producer finalization, sampling and concurrent CLI queue interactions without fabricating a finish or asserting a cause. Earlier changelog and producer2026.10.24 cohorts remain separate historical observations; only this canonical telemetry investigation is now actively claimed."
  "2026-10-27T10:16:23.940Z","harness:codex","Investigation result on final source7bca9b08: three temporary sandbox cases exercised start, finish and error capture with a valid consented installation and an unrelated optional statuses file changed to invalid JSON. All3 already pass without production edits, preserving settings and malformed-file bytes; parseOptionalJson reports a warning and ignores malformed optional content. This does not reproduce the live gap and does not justify a capture rewrite. The temporary experiment is retained in local evidence only. The live post-source window08:41:00..09:32:36.085UTC remains10starts/9finishes with one unmatched successful history invocation at09:23:31.637UTC; no server rejected events were found after09:23UTC and physical queues were empty. Foreground capture has a documented250ms best-effort mutex budget; existing tests intentionally require bounded omission without a late write when the lock is busy. Contention is plausible but unproven for this invocation. No budget, consent, sampling or success evidence was weakened and no synthetic finish was inserted. Historical producer2026.10.24 and interrupted changelog cohorts remain unresolved separately."
  "2026-10-27T11:33:41.678Z","harness:codex","Latest bounded final-source checkpoint after SDK flush: installation/session/command join2026-10-27T08:41:00Z..11:27:56.303Z contains143 starts/142 finishes and exactly one unequal group, independently re-read as history start09:23:31.637UTC with no finish. Earlier10/9 and82/81 post-source checkpoints remain immutable qualified observations; the interrupted changelog and original2026.10.24 cohorts remain separate. Fresh11:23UTC history start/finish arrived in0.738039/0.601494seconds, and a real Sentry pm history root span is visible at27.091ms; attribute enrichment remains unavailable. Required-mode live gate passes: zero recent Sentry critical/high issues, telemetry5.51percent<=6 and no missing error codes. Physical client event and OTLP queues are both0rows/0bytes. The last broker point read has0ready/1unacknowledged message, which is in-flight delivery evidence and not proof of permanent backlog or complete drainage. No full terminal pairing, cause or capture repair is claimed; the investigation stays open/unclaimed."
  "2026-10-27T16:22:51.510Z","harness:codex","Fresh required-mode observability check passes with zero recent Sentry critical/high issues,5.54percent telemetry errors against the unchanged6percent bound and zero missing error-code rows. Real history commands in this continuation have independently stored start/finish pairs:16:16:27UTC lags0.747/0.607seconds and16:19:19UTC lags0.761/0.674seconds. The point broker events queue is empty and services are healthy. These bounded current probes do not resolve the earlier unmatched-start cohorts or prove complete historical pairing. Tracing is being checked with the documented command-local opt-in; no persistent sampling, privacy or capture-budget configuration changed."
